OL,3,GNEWSAAttack victim's mother shocked as
OL,4,Afile 'left in taxi'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mother of a Nottingham attacks
OL,7,Fvictim has said she felt "shock and
OL,8,Fhorror but sadly not surprise" at
OL,9,Fclaims of police mislaying documents.
OL,11,FNottingham students Barnaby Webber and
OL,12,FGrace O'Malley-Kumar, and grandfather
OL,13,FIan Coates, were stabbed to death on 13
OL,14,FJune 2023 by Valdo Calocane, who was
OL,15,Fdiagnosed with paranoid schizophrenia
OL,16,Fin 2020.
OL,18,FEmma Webber said her legal team had
OL,19,Fconfirmed reports a file used by an
OL,20,Fofficer who had appeared at the public
OL,21,Finquiry into the attacks had been left
OL,22,Fin a taxi in March.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,369,360,200,160,0,100
